dlm: use defines for force values in dlm_release_lockspace

jira KERNEL-878
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.120.1.el8_10
commit-author Alexander Aring <aahringo@redhat.com>
commit bea90085dcb0f9a75748e73d723bde557a5ebf1a
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.120.1.el8_10/bea90085.failed

Clarify the use of the force parameter by renaming it to
"release_option" and adding defines (with descriptions) for
each of the accepted values.

	Signed-off-by: Alexander Aring <aahringo@redhat.com>
	Signed-off-by: David Teigland <teigland@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit bea90085dcb0f9a75748e73d723bde557a5ebf1a)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

# Conflicts:
#	fs/dlm/lockspace.c
